{"outcome":"component","existing":"","reason":"","code":"StoreLocation","label":"Store location","description":"The address of the shop with its opening hours, a map picture and a link that opens the location in an online map such as Google Maps, where the visitor can zoom. A site component runs no script and embeds no iframe, so the map itself is a still picture; use it on a contact or access page.","props":"[{"name": "title", "type": "text", "label": "Heading", "max": 120}, {"name": "address", "type": "text", "label": "Address", "help": "One line per part of the address.", "required": true, "max": 500}, {"name": "hours", "type": "html", "label": "Opening hours", "help": "Optional: opening days and hours."}, {"name": "map", "type": "image", "label": "Map picture", "help": "A screenshot or drawing of the map around the shop."}, {"name": "map_alt", "type": "text", "label": "Description of the map", "help": "What the map shows, in one sentence.", "max": 200}, {"name": "map_url", "type": "url", "label": "Link to the online map", "help": "The address of the shop in Google Maps or another map service."}, {"name": "link_label", "type": "text", "label": "Text of the link", "help": "Say where it leads, such as: Open the shop's location in Google Maps.", "max": 120}]","sample":"{"title": "Venir à la boutique", "address": "Boutique Thelia\n12 rue de la République\n63000 Clermont-Ferrand", "hours": "<p>Du mardi au samedi, de 10 h à 19 h.</p><p>Fermé le dimanche et le lundi.</p>", "map": null, "map_alt": "Plan du centre de Clermont-Ferrand, la boutique au coin de la rue de la République et de la place de Jaude.", "map_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=12+rue+de+la+R%C3%A9publique+63000+Clermont-Ferrand", "link_label": "Ouvrir l’emplacement de la boutique dans Google Maps"}","template":"<section class="location">{% if props.title is not empty %}<h2 class="location__title">{{ props.title }}</h2>{% endif %}<div class="location__body"><div class="location__info"><address class="location__address">{{ props.address|nl2br }}</address>{% if props.hours is not empty %}<div class="location__hours">{{ props.hours }}</div>{% endif %}{% if props.map_url is not empty and props.link_label is not empty %}<p class="location__action"><a class="location__link" href="{{ props.map_url }}">{{ props.link_label }}</a></p>{% endif %}</div>{% if props.map %}<div class="location__map" data-cms-sizes="(min-width: 48rem) 55vw, 100vw"><img class="location__image" src="{{ props.map }}" alt="{{ props.map_alt|default('') }}" loading="lazy"></div>{% endif %}</div></section>","css":".location__title { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
.location__body { display: grid; gap: 1.5rem; }
.location__address { font-style: normal; font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--cms-color-text); }
.location__hours { margin-top: 1rem; color: var(--cms-color-text-muted); }
.location__action { margin-top: 1.5rem; }
.location__link { display: inline-block; padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem; border-radius: 0.375rem; background: var(--cms-color-accent); color: var(--cms-color-on-accent); text-decoration: none; transition: background-color 0.2s ease; }
.location__link:hover { background: var(--cms-color-accent-strong); }
.location__link:focus-visible { background: var(--cms-color-accent-strong); outline: 2px solid var(--cms-color-accent-strong); outline-offset: 3px; }
.location__map { overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--cms-color-border); border-radius: 0.5rem; background: var(--cms-color-surface); }
.location__image { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
@media (min-width: 48rem) { .location__body { grid-template-columns: 2fr 3fr; align-items: start; gap: 2.5rem; } }"}
